      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_46",
        on: "start",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:recall_unit",
            id: "Dacyn",
            unit: "Dacyn",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:recall_unit",
            id: "Owaec",
            unit: "Owaec",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:recall_unit",
            id: "Addogin",
            unit: "Addogin",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:recall_unit",
            id: "Hahid al-Ali",
            unit: "Hahid al-Ali",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:recall_unit",
            id: "Terraent",
            unit: "Terraent",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:recall_unit",
            id: "Dolburras",
            unit: "Dolburras",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:recall_unit",
            id: "Grug",
            unit: "Grug",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Dacyn",
            text: _("Farmland, in these remote reaches? Our supply situation has become rather dire since abandoning the outposts, so we are fortunate to have found such a fertile valley."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Addogin",
            text: _("Huh, maybe throwin’ in my lot with you ain’t so bad after all. This place would make for a good retirement."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:scroll_to",
            x: 0,
            y: 0,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Prok-Bak",
            text: _("Don’t bother asking those freeloading dwarves for anything! They can’t even manage to pay their tribute on time."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Pelathsil",
            text: _("To flames with yer tribute! What’s ours be ours, and don’t no orcs nor any o’ ye humans be tryin and takin’ it!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Pelathsil",
            text: _("Never! Not since tha days o’ Relgorn and Delfador ha’ any o’ our clan helped one o’ ye gangly humans!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Aleii",
            text: _("Hsss... orcsss, dwarvesss, humansss. We have traveled far to find thisss warmth. I have called the vote; the clutch has ssspoken. These waters are only for Naga. Leave usss be."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Prok-Bak",
            text: _("That’s Whitefang territory you’re squatting in, snake! Show some respect for the Chief!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Bagork",
            text: _("And I bet they haven’t paid tribute either! Dwarves, snakes, humans, I say we kill ’em all!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Dacyn",
            text: _("Gweddry, we will have to reprovision despite this conflict. If we spend cautiously and control enough farms, we should be able to gather enough supplies to see us through the winter."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_48",
        on: "moveto",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$unit_moved_id",
                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22Dolburras%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter_adjacent%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22Pelathsil%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Dolburras",
            text: _("Oi, mud-fer-brains! What do ye think ye be doin’, fighin’ wi’ these men o’ Wesnoth?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Pelathsil",
            text: _("Men o’ Wesnoth ain’t dwarves! I be a dwarf lord, not a man-friend."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Dolburras",
            text: _("Aye, and so instead ye send yer subjects to die on man-spears? What kind o’ lordship be that? If ye dinnae want ta help us, at least dinnae fight us!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Pelathsil",
            text: _("A man-friend and a blood-traitor ye be... but I suppose I can see yer point. We won’t be fightin’ ye any longer."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:config_side",
            side: 2,
            team_name: "good",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:set_achievement",
            id: "ei_S08",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:show_objectives",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_49",
        on: "die",
