            equals: 7,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Owaec",
            text: _("... I have held my tongue long enough. While Wesnoth bleeds, the High Advisor leads us north to forage for food. And as our men and our people die, we seek an unknown mage hovel with some unknown power that the High Advisor has yet to explain more about. Gweddry, surely you feel this is strange?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Gweddry",
            text: _("I don’t know, Owaec. It is odd, but Dacyn’s light and wisdom are well-known throughout Wesnoth."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Owaec",
            text: _("So were his friend Ravan’s, if Dacyn’s story is to be believed."),
          },
        ],
